{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|SE_Rage_Description", "source_en": "Target gains increased damage amplified by the number of stacks.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "تزداد أضرار الهدف بزيادة عدد التراكمات.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|SE_Sunderance_Description", "source_en": "Target has lowered resistance to all status effects and damage.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "تنخفض مقاومة الهدف لجميع تأثيرات الحالة والأضرار.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|SE_Mark_Description", "source_en": "Target is Marked by evil and takes higher critical damage from hits.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "الهدف مٌوسوم بالشر ويتلقى أضراراً حرجة أعلى عند الإصابة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|SE_Poison_Description", "source_en": "Target is poisoned and takes damage over time once enough poison stacks are added.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "الهدف مسموم ويتلقى أضراراً مستمرة بمجرد تراكم كمية كافية من السم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|SE_Burn_Description", "source_en": "Target is set on fire, taking damage over time based on fire stacks. Dodge roll to deactivate.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "الهدف مشتعل، ويتلقى أضراراً مستمرة بناءً على تراكمات النار. استخدم دحرجة المراوغة لإطفائه.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|SE_Bleed_Description", "source_en": "Target takes damage over time while bleeding.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "يتلقى الهدف أضراراً مستمرة أثناء النزيف.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_ItemDetailLabels|Weight", "source_en": "Weight", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "الوزن", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_bloodfuryboon", "source_en": "A Bleeding enemy should speed your blade. Do not suffer them to live.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "يجب أن تسرع نصلك أمام العدو النازف. لا تتركهم يعيشون.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Sanguiboon", "source_en": "A bleeding enemy makes a valuable target.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "العدو النازف هدف ثمين.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Heavenstithe", "source_en": "All shall pay Heaven's Tithe. Slay five or more enemies while fighting as an angel and your grace increases upon returning to mortal flesh.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "سيدفع الجميع ضريبة السماء. اقتل خمسة أعداء أو أكثر أثناء القتال في هيئة الملاك، وستزداد نعمتك عند العودة إلى الجسد الفاني.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Nexusgate", "source_en": "During your runs you can acquire boons from Nexus Gates. These are temporary buffs that remain with you during your runs but go away afterwards.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "يمكنك الحصول على بركات من بوابات النكسوس أثناء جولاتك. هذه تعزيزات مؤقتة تبقى معك خلال الجولة وتختفي بعدها.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Blockhint", "source_en": "In the haze of battle, defense is your best ally. Your grace increases with each successful block, up to 33%.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "في ضباب المعركة، الدفاع هو حليفك الأفضل. تزداد نعمتك مع كل صد ناجح، حتى 33%.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Purification", "source_en": "Only the pure shall pass. Items you manage to keep upon completing a run will become Purified and will remain with you in future loadouts.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "لن يمر إلا الطاهرون. العناصر التي تنجح في الاحتفاظ بها عند إكمال الرحلة ستصبح \"مُطهرة\" وستبقى معك في التجهيزات المستقبلية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_rekilled", "source_en": "Remember, what's reborn can be rekilled. None are beyond the reach of an angel's sword.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "تذكر، ما وُلد من جديد يمكن قتله مرة أخرى. لا يوجد شيء خارج نطاق وصول سيف الملاك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Surgeboon", "source_en": "The flesh remembers the angel's form. When exiting Angel Ascension, you have unlimited Stamina that lasts for 5 seconds. Use this time wisely.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "الجسد يتذكر هيئة الملاك. عند الخروج من الصعود الملائكي، ستحصل على قدرة على التحمل غير محدودة لمدة 5 ثوانٍ. استخدم هذا الوقت بحكمة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Angelicboon", "source_en": "Through your angelic lineage, untold power flows through your sword. Use it to make the unclean pay for their sins. ", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "من خلال نسبك الملائكي، تتدفق قوة لا توصف عبر سيفك. استخدمها لجعل الأنجاس يدفعون ثمن خطاياهم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
{"id": "ST_LoadingScreens|LS_Divineboon", "source_en": "To hit a Staggered enemy is to mark them. Now finish them.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "ضرب عدو مذهول يعني وسمه. الآن، أنهِ أمره.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 43}}
